# Keep text files LF in every checkout. Windows otherwise converts them to
# CRLF, which changes the bytes bundled into the MSIX (the extension files are
# packaged as-is) and makes the artifact differ by host for no functional gain.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touch binary content.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.msix binary
*.exe binary
*.dmg binary
*.dll binary
